{"id":94,"verses":[{"number":1,"arabicText":"أَلَمْ نَشْرَحْ لَكَ صَدْرَكَ","transliteration":"Alam nashraḥ laka ṣadrak","translation":"Did We not expand for you, [O Muhammad], your breast?"},{"number":2,"arabicText":"وَوَضَعْنَا عَنكَ وِزْرَكَ","transliteration":"Wawaḍaʿnā ʿanka wiz'rak","translation":"And We removed from you your burden"},{"number":3,"arabicText":"ٱلَّذِىٓ أَنقَضَ ظَهْرَكَ","transliteration":"Alladhī anqaḍa ẓahrak","translation":"Which had weighed upon your back"},{"number":4,"arabicText":"وَرَفَعْنَا لَكَ ذِكْرَكَ","transliteration":"Warafaʿnā laka dhik'rak","translation":"And raised high for you your repute."},{"number":5,"arabicText":"فَإِنَّ مَعَ ٱلْعُسْرِ يُسْرًا","transliteration":"Fa-inna maʿa l-ʿus'ri yus'ran","translation":"For indeed, with hardship [will be] ease."},{"number":6,"arabicText":"إِنَّ مَعَ ٱلْعُسْرِ يُسْرًۭا","transliteration":"Inna maʿa l-ʿus'ri yus'ran","translation":"Indeed, with hardship [will be] ease."},{"number":7,"arabicText":"فَإِذَا فَرَغْتَ فَٱنصَبْ","transliteration":"Fa-idhā faraghta fa-inṣab","translation":"So when you have finished [your duties], then stand up [for worship]."},{"number":8,"arabicText":"وَإِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ فَٱرْغَب","transliteration":"Wa-ilā rabbika fa-ir'ghab","translation":"And to your Lord direct [your] longing."}]}